{"id":"vod_sn_38802","vodId":"38802","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"四季樱","name_cn":"四季樱","date":"2021-01-01","year":"2021","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/40c8f66982a0a9e84b1912ebf17466e3.jpg"},"summary":"这是一个人鬼混居的世界，鬼通过附身在人身上的方式来达到抵达现世的目的。能够从鬼手中保护人类的，是可以穿上动力服“铠”的战士们，动力服融合了古代秘术与最新的科技，拥有强大的力量。　　三轮翔（野田雄大 配音）本是平凡的男子高中生，心中充满了正义感，还有对于英雄的憧憬。在误打误撞之中，翔穿上了动力服，并且加入了和鬼进行战斗的小队之中。在那里，翔结识了拥有将鬼送往异世界的能力的女巫明神逢花（茉白实步 配音）、世世代代守护女巫一组的“忍者”服部凉（水上翔斗 配音）以及同样拥有与鬼交战的能力的女生成濑枫（坂崎绘理 配音）等人。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:04:45","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DnxT4nXjbm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dLeCpLERAL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/raEwLLGLTN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/G0kFyXYkbw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/udVWbeL7jM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jcxzvUrv5z1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/iXJLP9uZt01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mEwVSSvkQv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PiNV19G4Fq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rW9A9FZcxL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Grs5FmSgaQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/AsRvbzfqit1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:54.121Z"}